## 6️⃣ Debugging Checklist

| Symptom | Likely cause | Fix |
|---------|--------------|-----|
| **Map stays gray / no tiles** | CORS missing or `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` not set | Add CORS header on the host |
| **Console shows `Range` request failed (416)`** | Host does not support HTTP Range or the `Accept-Ranges` header is missing | Switch to a host that supports range (S3, R2, Netlify, etc.) |
| **Zoom levels > maxZoom show blank tiles** | You used `tiles:` instead of `url:` (MapLibre assumes maxzoom = 22) | Change source definition to use `url:` |
| **Layer colors look wrong** | Wrong `source-layer` name or missing style properties | Run `pmtiles show <file>` to verify layer names |
| **Performance is slow** | No CDN, or the file is being served without caching | Put the .pmtiles file behind CloudFront/Cloudflare and set long `Cache-Control` |

